Before ContentBlockerManager.initialize() the harness registers the list
URLProtocol and starts a main-queue heartbeat (a 100 ms Timer in the common
modes) that logs every gap over 250 ms and every change of a list's
rulesFormat key; it also logs each .contentBlockerRulesDidChange. Once the
